<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>悬浮URL 1.3.1</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>总开关</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮窗</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl/settingsChanged</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>网页</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>悬浮窗打开后加载的网址。可填 http(s) 网页，也可填 app/插件 scheme（如 weixin://、tel:10086、cydia://package/com.xxx、sileo://package/com.xxx），打开即拉起对应 app。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>url</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>网址 URL</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>https://www.apple.com</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>快捷URI（扇形两层）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>点开悬浮球会朝屏幕内侧展开半圆扇形：URL 球固定不动，第一层最多 4 个、第二层最多 6 个（共 10 个，加几个排几个，超过 4 个才溢出到第二层）。网页类入口（http/https）打开是浏览器面板；非网页类（如 weixin://、tel:）直接拉起对应 app（触发方式可在下方「触发方式」里改）。每个入口可自定义图标（从相册选，自动压缩）、标签（2 个汉字或 3 个字母），以及网址/scheme。长按扇形图标可就地编辑。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>管理快捷URI</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>manageUrls</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>布局调节（左/右 + 扇形两层）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>停靠边：悬浮球固定在屏幕左侧或右侧边缘、竖直居中（只有左/右两种，没有横纵坐标）；图标大小、图标间隔：扇形上快捷图标的尺寸与圈层间距。进「布局实时预览」拖滑杆，预览立即变化，手机上的悬浮球同步生效（改动即存，无需另点保存）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>布局实时预览（左/右 + 大小/间隔）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showLayout</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发方式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>关闭（默认）：点扇形图标直接触发——网页类直接打开浏览器面板，非网页类（如 weixin://、tel:）直接拉起对应 app。开启：点扇形图标不直接触发，先弹确认框（输入框+打开按钮），点「打开」才执行。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>tapConfirm</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>点扇形图标后需确认</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl/settingsChanged</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>更多</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>说明书/玩法：各种 URL 与 scheme 示例，长按即可复制。隐藏悬浮窗的 App（黑名单）：默认所有 App 都显示悬浮窗，勾选某个 App = 在该 App 内隐藏球（桌面同样遵循，不勾就不隐藏）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>说明书 / 玩法</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showGuide</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>隐藏悬浮窗的 App（黑名单）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>showAppList</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>窗口大小（默认主页）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>340</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>240</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>600</real>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>winWidth</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>宽度</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>480</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>320</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>900</real>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm.floatingurl</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>winHeight</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>高度</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关于</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>系统级悬浮窗：可拖动小球常驻屏幕，点开两层扇形快捷环（URL+第一层4+第二层6），网页/scheme 一键直达；全 App 及主屏幕可用。松手靠近屏幕边才吸附（只露一半），点击拉回。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
